      ],
      "text": "The runtime is organized as packages: benson-core (intent parsing), orca-core (runtime, event bus, SQLite persistence), maestro-core (role routing), pappy-core (QC verdicts), miranda-core (compliance gate), workbench-core (tool execution), and dewey-core (context store)."
    },
