        "slc_98b6d1539e8fef5d91b1f2b326a7292655e6f8ba59fc211ac6ac93a95236e31f"
      ],
      "text": "The pipeline routes user input through Benson (intent parsing) to an Orca Runtime that orchestrates Maestro role routing, Pappy QC (PASS/WARN/FAIL), and Miranda compliance with a repair loop."
    },
