      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_98b6d1539e8fef5d91b1f2b326a7292655e6f8ba59fc211ac6ac93a95236e31f"
      ],
      "text": "Roles include brain (decompose/route), strong_model, cheap_model, reviewer, narrator, planner_deep, debugger, reader, and vision; several roles are optional with documented fallbacks (e.g. planner_deep falls back to brain)."
    },
