        "slc_0e49ed539642453c1f2e56a4ccf7af3153c2269b04aa0cfbe6da17a8814c630c"
      ],
      "text": "Task permissions can only add filesystem-write or shell capabilities, and when both fileWrite and shellExec are false the runtime removes write, shell, and github-write groups regardless of role baseline."
