  "summary": "Selected evidence records: The runtime is organized as packages: benson-core (intent parsing), orca-core (runtime, event bus, SQLite persistence), maestro-core (role routing), pappy-core (QC verdicts), miranda-core (compliance gate), workbench-core (tool execution), and dewey-core (context store). The pipeline routes user input through Benson (intent parsing) to an Orca Runtime that orchestrates Maestro role routing, Pappy QC (PASS/WARN/FAIL), and Miranda compliance with a repair loop.",
